title The recant a run publishes, read once for the whole ladder
prompt Standfast on reds, then take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, deep-read one council-rota row, sweep the prose Radiant, and send.
think Standfast opened the lap rather than assuming it. The era suite ran GREEN at ten on metal before any code moved -- rung 9 proving the REDS spine, the headline, and every row's three fields together, rung 10 measuring the delegating stub off disk -- and every living row through %129 read closed. The line stood clear, so constructive work was licensed.
think The named crux came off the prior lap's recommend line and off the carry witness's own printed queue: recant_published, thirty-seven rungs by twenty lines, 612 by realized fall, the head that widens nothing. Measurement before the lift rather than after: hashing every body across the caravan modules proved all thirty-seven byte-identical at twenty lines, all thirty-seven already published, and all five reached symbols -- max_queue_len, max_note_path_len, note_path, plan_name, phase_bit -- public in every one.
think The lift itself is the shape the eight folds before it wrote. One published fn recant_published(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, held: u32) u32 appended to caravan/ladder_checks.rye, reaching every contract symbol through the type handed in; each of the thirty-seven rungs reduced to a three-line stub returning ladder_checks.recant_published(@This(), io, held).
think The carry witness and its scan were repinned from the meter rather than from arithmetic -- carried=75730 ceiling=75736, bodies 18163 distinct=7959 -- and the fold queue prose rewritten from a fresh measurement of the next eight families rather than carried forward.
think The rota row was read whole before the record was written, so the reading shaped the lap rather than decorating it.
obs Prediction met measurement to the digit for the ninth lap running. The realized fall is (identical_copies - 1) x (body_lines - stub_lines), and a delegating stub is the signature plus two lines, so 36 x (20 - 3) = 612. Carry fell 76,342 to 75,730 -- a fall of 612. Delegates rose 2,841 to 2,878, exactly the thirty-seven stubs, which is how a reader tells a fold from a cost moved somewhere cheaper to count. Bodies 18,162 to 18,163 and distinct 7,957 to 7,959 -- the one published body the fold added. Families hold at 705.
obs This is the fifth fold in a row to widen nothing, and it closes the glyph-note family. bearing_published, lost_published, appraisal_published, and recant_published each open a glyph note, walk it against the held count, and fold it to a phase mask, differing only in the note suffix and the glyph they count. All four now stand in ladder_checks together, so the four-way merge into one body taking suffix and glyph as comptime parameters is a single readable round rather than a survey.
obs The next head is measured rather than inherited, and the measurement changed the queue. confirm returns 528 -- forty-six rungs declare it and forty-five write one identical body at fifteen lines over a one-line signature -- and it widens exactly one declaration, since read_count stands public in forty-five of the forty-six and private in the one. load_one matches the number at 528 and stands private in all sixty-seven, so it would open sixty-seven. A family's own visibility still says nothing about what its body reaches; that lesson now cuts both ways, since it also finds the cheap head.
obs Council rota, row two -- Fire and Mars, cut and stop. Standfast named the stop this lap actually took at its opening rather than at a defect, which is the quieter half of the discipline: a line held clear is still a line checked. Reds-first priced why the check comes before the constructive work, since the allocation belongs to a red the moment one is real. And the three depths of removal put this lap's own cut in its place -- a fold removes 612 duplicate lines while every behavior and every name stays exactly where it stood, so it is compression under accrete rather than molt, breach, or debride. No cairn is owed, because nothing was let go.
obs One honest note carried forward. caravan_reclaim_witness went RED once inside the suite and GREEN alone, the same two-rye-build staging race the note_path lap named and recorded. A witness is measured on a quiet tree, and the second run of the whole suite stood GREEN at 107.
