file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish repinned to the measured carry and its fold queue rewritten from this lap's measurement
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling lowered to 75,736, the fall this fold earned
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now block refilled with the live lap and the finished roster round condensed into the prior-edges line
recommend keep-going confirm at forty-six rungs by fifteen lines -- 528 by realized fall, forty-five identical bodies over a one-line signature, widening exactly one declaration since read_count stands private in one of the forty-six. load_one matches the number and would open sixty-seven; renew_path (720) and ask_path (660) each widen thirty-one; choose_pass (630) opens three. Beside the queue, the four-way glyph-note merge is now the cheaper and more readable round, since all four bodies finally sit in one file.
